Coverage: session 0..20s with samples every 1s. Game duration is 10s, EndTime 12:10:00 → startUs 0 (since startEpoch=end-10s), endUs=10s. Within session. Good. StopUs=20s. Coverage 100% (samples hold 2s). Good.

Wait the PGN fixture has `[EndDate]` and `[EndTime]`, no UTC. parse uses EndTime. Good.

Session helper: `startSession(root, { monoUs: 0, epochMs: startEpoch }, '60')`. Existing signature:
```ts
async function session(root, samples, stopUs): Promise<string> { ... EPOCH ...}
```
Add `startEpoch = EPOCH` param:
```ts
async function session(root, samples, stopUs, startEpoch = EPOCH)
```
and use startEpoch in startSession and stopSession epoch. Then existing calls unchanged.

- Test "a move into stalemate from a won position is a blunder" could also be report-level but unit is fine.

