App session event handler lines 134-145 earlier:
```ts
return bridge.onSessionEnded((event) => {
  const parsed = ...
  adoptSession(parsed.data.sessionId);
  terminalSessionRef.current = parsed.data.sessionId;
  setPhase('stopped');
